# Suwasiri

Sri Lankan digital health: **Flutter mobile** (repo root) + **GP Care web** (`web/`) + **LankaLab Portal** (`lankalab/`) + **PharmaCloud** (`pharmacloud/`). Production backend is Firebase (`suwasiri-91824`).

## Four apps — keep them parallel

- **Mobile:** do not change Flutter/Dart/`lib/`/`android/`/`ios/` unless the user explicitly asks.
- **GP Care:** live in `web/`. Keep the **exact** stack (React 19, Vite, Express `server.ts`, Tailwind). Local **http://localhost:3000**.
- **LankaLab:** live in `lankalab/`. Keep the **exact** stack (React 19, Vite, Express `server.ts`, Tailwind). Local **http://localhost:3001**.
- **PharmaCloud:** live in `pharmacloud/`. Keep the **exact** stack (React 19, Vite, Express `server.ts`, Tailwind). Local **http://localhost:3002**.
- Do **not** edit the originals at `C:\Users\HP\Downloads\sri-lankan-gp-care`, `C:\Users\HP\Downloads\lankalab-portal`, or `C:\Users\HP\Downloads\sri-lanka-pharmacloud`.
- Sync via shared Firebase data, not by merging UI codebases. See `docs/WEB.md`, `docs/LANKALAB.md`, and `docs/PHARMACLOUD.md`.

## Before changing code

Read and keep updated:

- `docs/STATUS.md` — what works / what's next
- `docs/FIREBASE.md` — project IDs, collections, CLI
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — where code lives
- `docs/WEB.md` — GP Care web app and mobile/web sync
- `docs/LANKALAB.md` — LankaLab portal (`lankalab/`)
- `docs/PHARMACLOUD.md` — PharmaCloud pharmacy gateway (`pharmacloud/`)
- `docs/ROADMAP.md` — prioritized work

## Backend rules

- `AppConstants.useDemoBackend` must stay **`false`**.
- Production wiring: `FirebaseAuthRepository` + `FirebaseHealthRepository` via `AppServices.bootstrap()`.
- Demo repos only through `AppServices.forTesting` (widget tests).
- Package / bundle: `com.thepatientcare.suwasiri`.

## Implementation rules

- UI → Cubits → repository interfaces → Firebase implementations.
- Persist via Firestore collections documented in `docs/FIREBASE.md`; update `firestore.rules` when adding collections.
- After finishing a chunk: tick items in `docs/STATUS.md` and adjust `docs/ROADMAP.md`.

## Phone / Google notes

- Phone OTP still uses demo code `123456` (synthetic Firebase email) until real Phone Auth.
- Google Sign-In needs SHA fingerprints in Firebase Console for Android.
